@startuml

title National Directory Update Use Case Actors

Object "Providers and Payers Actor" as Payer2 #LightGoldenRodYellow
Payer2 : Plan Network management (enrollment&contracting)
Payer2 : Plan Claims management
Payer2 : Accountable Care Organization (ACO)
Payer2 : Value based plan
Payer2 : Managed care plan Organization
Payer2 : Credentialing
Payer2 : Compliance/auditing staff
Payer2 : System or Services (Patient attribution service ect.)

Object NationalDirectory #LightSalmon
NationalDirectory : A centralized data hub \nfor healthcare directory information,\noffering accurate and verified data, \nalong with FHIR APIs for maintaining the data.
NationalDirectory : Providing a single source of truth for \nhealth plan networks, \nprovider directories, \nand facility directories.\n
NationalDirectory : Supporting the following update use cases:
NationalDirectory : Creating directory records,
NationalDirectory : Updating provider and organization data,
NationalDirectory : Maintaining network and insurance plan data,
NationalDirectory : Maintaining relationships and endpoints,
NationalDirectory : Deactivating records no longer in effect.

Object "States HIE/HIN Actor" as States #LightGoldenRodYellow
States : Incorporate regional and national HINs \nto facilitate interoperability

Payer2 -down-> NationalDirectory
States -up-> NationalDirectory

Payer2 : Submits:
Payer2 : organization, practitioner, \npractitioner role, and affiliation data \n
Payer2 : network, insurance plan, \nand coverage area data \n
Payer2 : location, group, healthcare service, \nand endpoint data \n

States : Submits:
States : endpoint and affiliation data \nfor network topologies

@enduml
